\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces \relax \fontsize  {9}{10}\selectfont  The spatial temporal graph of a skeleton sequence used in this work where the proposed ST-GCN operate on. Blue dots denote the body joints. The intra-body edges between body joints are defined based on the natural connections in human bodies. The inter-frame edges connect the same joints between consecutive frames. Joint coordinates are used as inputs to the ST-GCN.}}{1}{figure.1}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:teaser_intro}{{1}{1}{\small The spatial temporal graph of a skeleton sequence used in this work where the proposed ST-GCN operate on. Blue dots denote the body joints. The intra-body edges between body joints are defined based on the natural connections in human bodies. The inter-frame edges connect the same joints between consecutive frames. Joint coordinates are used as inputs to the ST-GCN}{figure.1}{}}
